<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="recommended-gear">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c9" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/spell_shadow_rainoffire.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Recommended Gear for Destruction Warlocks in Mists of Pandaria Classic</span></h2>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="what-is-the-bis-destruction-warlock-gear">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c9" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_misc_questionmark.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> What is the BiS Destruction Warlock gear?</h3>With many different sources of gear and loot scarcity in Mists of Pandaria Classic, targeting your absolute Best in Slot gear isn't entirely realistic; instead, we've created a Best in Slot list from the ideal Destruction Warlock drops found in Phase 3 from raids, dungeons, Reputation, and World Bosses to help you decide what to prioritize.<div class="pad exclude-units"></div>While raid drops are generally the most reliable way of getting high item level gear, many other items can be just as good, if not better, so you should reference the <a data-contiguous="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/guide/classes/warlock/destruction/dps-stat-priority-pve">Stat Priorities for Destruction Warlocks</a> to help determine your own BiS gear based on what is available to you.<ul class="exclude-units"></ul>
<br/>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="bis-gear">Overall Best in Slot Gear for Destruction Warlocks</h3>This list represents the best gear currently available for Destruction Warlocks, all of which is attained from the raid, Throne of Thunder, in the Heroic Difficulty. This list excludes Thunderforged loot that doesn't drop from <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=69473/ra-den">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Ra-den</span></a>, as the odds of gathering the entire complete BiS gear set of Thunderforged loot are close to none.<div class="pad exclude-units"></div>
