<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="set-bonuses">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c9" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_misc_treasurechest02b.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Tier &amp; Set Bonuses for Destruction Warlocks in Mists of Pandaria Classic</span></h2>The Tier 15 set bonuses offer strong synergy with Destruction's core mechanics. The <b>2-piece bonus</b> causes <a class="icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=116858/chaos-bolt">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_warlock_chaosbolt.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Chaos Bolt</span></a> and  <a class="icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=17877/shadowburn">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_shadow_scourgebuild.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Shadowburn</span></a> to cost 20% less Embers. The <b>4-piece bonus</b> causes your <a class="icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=29722/incinerate">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_fire_burnout.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Incinerate</span></a> to have a proc chance of 8% to provide double the amount of Embers.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="tier-15">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">Tier 15 - <a data-entity="item-set" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item-set=1171/regalia-of-the-thousandfold-hells">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Regalia of the Thousandfold Hells</span></a></span></h3>
<div class="wh-center" style="text-align: -webkit-center;">
<div class="markup-table-wrapper">
<table class="exclude-units grid" style="width: 500px; max-width: 100%;">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td data-background="c9" style="width: 30%; max-width: 100%;">
<b>Set Count</b></td>
<td data-background="c9">
<b>Bonus</b></td></tr>
<tr>
<td>2 Piece</td>
<td>
<span>While Dark Soul is active, Haunt's duration is increased by 4 sec, Chaos Bolt and Shadowburn consume 20% less Embers, and abilities cost 30% less Demonic Fury.</span></td></tr>
<tr>
<td>4 Piece</td>
<td>
<span>Your Malefic Grasp and Drain Soul deal 5% more periodic damage, your Incinerate has a 8% chance to generate twice the normal Embers, and your spells generate 10% more Demonic Fury.</span></td></tr>
<tr>
<td data-background="c9" style="width: 30%; max-width: 100%;">
<b>Item Slot</b></td>
<td data-background="c9">
